   "updated_at": "2026-11-02T17:05:40Z",
   "body": "**Operator choice O-1** (ADR 0014, PR #442): FEAT-013 says \"exact\", and no local renderer is exact by construction. Please record one of:\n\n- **(a)** local renderer only, labelled as a preview in LOT-152 — the ADR's recommendation now: measured against HFR's own rendering on five captured pairs, no request, works offline, the draft leaves the device only when posted;\n- **(b)** local renderer **plus** an on-demand \"aperçu HFR\" action calling `POST /apercu.php` (a later `HFRClient` lot: session, `hash_check`, one POST per request) — the recommendation if users report differences;\n- **(c)** `/apercu.php` only, no local renderer — gives up the offline and silent preview; LOT-097 would then be closed as not planned and a new lot opened in `HFRClient`.\n\nThe ADR proceeds under (a) or (b): the renderer PR is on hold until this choice and the ADR merge.\n\nAlso opened for this lot: capture issue #443 (`host: mac`, batch 2 of BBCode pairs through `/apercu.php`, every remaining fidelity gap listed).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
